    "title": "Human Metapneumovirus Surging in US, California - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago HMPV (Human Metapneumovirus) is currently spiking in the United States, including Northern California cities like Sacramento, Davis, Vallejo and San Francisco. Human Metapneumovirus Circulating in the US: Human metapneumovirus—a seasonal respiratory virus in the same family as Respiratory syncytial virus—is currently rising in the US, according to surveillance data from National Respiratory and Enteric Virus Surveillance System. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
